  "type": "object",
  "title": "SubjectState element schema",
  "description": "\nStructured information on a temporary state of a subject.\n\nArgs\n----\nadditional_remarks : str\n    Mention of what deserves additional attention or notice.\nage : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    Time of life or existence at which some particular qualification, capacity or event arises.\nage_category : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.age_category.AgeCategory\n    Distinct life cycle class that is defined by a similar age or age range (developmental stage) within a group of individual beings.\nattributes : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.subject_attribute.SubjectAttribute\n    no description available\ndescended_from : ~openminds.latest.core.research.subject_state.SubjectState\n    no description available\nhandedness : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.handedness.Handedness\n    Degree to which an organism prefers one hand or foot over the other hand or foot during the performance of a task.\ninternal_identifier : str\n    Term or code that identifies the subject state within a particular product.\nlookup_label : str\n    no description available\npathologies : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.disease.Disease, ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.disease_model.DiseaseModel\n    Structural and functional deviation from the normal that constitutes a disease or characterizes a particular disease.\nrelative_time_indication : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    no description available\nweight : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    Amount that a thing or being weighs.\n\n",
  "schema:name": "subjectstate",
  "schema:description": "\nStructured information on a temporary state of a subject.\n\nArgs\n----\nadditional_remarks : str\n    Mention of what deserves additional attention or notice.\nage : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    Time of life or existence at which some particular qualification, capacity or event arises.\nage_category : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.age_category.AgeCategory\n    Distinct life cycle class that is defined by a similar age or age range (developmental stage) within a group of individual beings.\nattributes : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.subject_attribute.SubjectAttribute\n    no description available\ndescended_from : ~openminds.latest.core.research.subject_state.SubjectState\n    no description available\nhandedness : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.handedness.Handedness\n    Degree to which an organism prefers one hand or foot over the other hand or foot during the performance of a task.\ninternal_identifier : str\n    Term or code that identifies the subject state within a particular product.\nlookup_label : str\n    no description available\npathologies : ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.disease.Disease, ~openminds.latest.controlled_terms.disease_model.DiseaseModel\n    Structural and functional deviation from the normal that constitutes a disease or characterizes a particular disease.\nrelative_time_indication : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    no description available\nweight : ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value.QuantitativeValue, ~openminds.latest.core.miscellaneous.quantitative_value_range.QuantitativeValueRange\n    Amount that a thing or being weighs.\n\n",
